  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Loading_Backgrounds_Resourcepacks/MP_LoadingBackgrounds_NewGame2_header.webp\" width=\"1707\" height=\"549\"></strong></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">此資源包旨在為《New Game 2》整合包提供獨特的載入背景圖片。不過，您也可以自由將其用於任何您喜歡的其他整合包——它完全相容！</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">需要安裝模組：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/loading-backgrounds\" rel=\"nofollow\">Loading Backgrounds</a>。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>需要伺服器與朋友一同遊玩嗎？</strong></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Loading_Backgrounds/BH_LB_promo.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"250\"></strong></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">如果您正在尋找能與朋友一起遊玩任何模組或整合包的伺服器，<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bisect Hosting</a></strong> 就是您的最佳選擇！他們提供最優質且價格實惠的 Minecraft 伺服器，若您點擊<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">此連結</a></strong>，並使用折扣碼「Lupin」，即可享受 25% 的優惠。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Loading_Backgrounds/BH_LB_banner1.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"150\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:24px\"><strong>伺服器上可以使用嗎？</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">當然可以！運作完全正常！請記住，搭配模組與朋友遊玩的最佳方式就是使用 BisectHosting，並且透過<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252flupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">點擊此連結即可獲得 25% 折扣</a></strong>。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>此資源包能否用於整合包中？</strong></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">當然可以！前提是僅限於在 Modrinth 或 CurseForge 上發布。上傳至任何其他平台都將侵犯我們的權利，且嚴格禁止。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">不過，如果您考慮將其加入您的 Modrinth 或 CurseForge 整合包，我們將不勝感激。若您需要進行任何微調或有其他疑問，歡迎隨時聯繫我們！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>我可以錄製此模組的影片並在我的頻道中展示嗎？</strong></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">當然可以！您可以自由在頻道中遊玩此模組或我們的任何整合包並製作相關影片，事實上，我們會非常感謝您的支持！</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Loading_Backgrounds_Resourcepacks/MP_LoadingBackgrounds_NewGame2_screenshot1.webp\" width=\"1707\" height=\"1089\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Loading_Backgrounds_Resourcepacks/MP_LoadingBackgrounds_NewGame2_screenshot2.webp\" width=\"1707\" height=\"1089\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Loading_Backgrounds_Resourcepacks/MP_LoadingBackgrounds_NewGame2_screenshot3.webp\" width=\"1707\" height=\"1089\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Loading_Backgrounds_Resourcepacks/MP_LoadingBackgrounds_NewGame2_screenshot4.webp\" width=\"1707\" height=\"1089\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/X8VY5WMbe4\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MultiRecipe/BH_Lupin_Discord.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"285\"></strong></span></a></span></p>",
